@title Docked forms: a long form, a short form and two at once open at a sensible height
@sizes 1366x768 1920x1080
@area Windows
# The forms that dock at the right edge through panel::modal: Add PLC card (long), New crane project (short).
fresh
key ctrl+n
wait 20
key ctrl+k
wait 4
text add plc card
wait 6
key Enter
wait 30
shot a-long-form-add-plc-card
click_text "Cancel"
wait 15
key ctrl+k
wait 4
text new pages
wait 6
key Enter
wait 30
shot b-short-form-new-crane-project
key ctrl+k
wait 4
text add plc card
wait 6
key Enter
wait 30
shot c-two-docked-at-once
check_layout
